# German translations of the ImplementationGuide resource's own fields —
# breadcrumbs, TOC entries and section captions render from
# ImplementationGuide.definition.page.title, so without this file the /de/
# pages keep the English page titles even though their CONTENT is German.
# Same mechanism as kerndatensatz-basis
# (input/translations/de/ImplementationGuide-mii-ig-base.po, verified 2026-07-30).
# msgid must equal the exact title in sushi-config.yaml `pages:`; the German
# names mirror input/translations/de/includes/menu.xml so menu, breadcrumb and
# caption agree. Placeholders resolve like everywhere else — replace them when
# you create a module, AND RENAME THIS FILE to match your IG id
# (ImplementationGuide-mii-ig-<your-slug>.po); the publisher finds the
# catalog by resource id. The CI self-check does both for the preview.

